---
import Base from '@layouts/Base.astro';
import { REPO } from '@lib/constants';
---

<Base title="Nightly channel" description="Docs and builds from the main branch.">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="page-head">
      <h1>Nightly channel</h1>
      <p class="summary">
        The site ships in two channels. Stable follows tagged releases; nightly
        tracks the main branch and ships the newest docs and scenes first.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Nightly APKs are built by the repository's nightly workflow and published
        as pre-releases on <a href={`${REPO}/releases`} rel="noopener">GitHub Releases</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        When the nightly docs channel goes live, this directory serves the docs
        build generated from the main branch, with its own live bundle and
        manifest under <code>/nightly/</code>. Until then this page marks where
        the mirror lands.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
